Here `info` can be nil on error.
```suggestion
	info, err := os.Stat(cfg.Path)
	if err == nil {
	      if info.IsDir() {
		      m.state = stateShowStash
	      } else {
		      m.state = stateShowDocument
		      m.pager.currentDocument = markdown{
			      localPath: cfg.Path,
			      Note:      stripAbsolutePath(cfg.Path, ""),
			      Modtime:   info.ModTime(),
		      }
	      }
	}
```
